{`v`:`story_v1`,`room`:`TIME`,`title`:`The Clock Repairer`,`titleVN`:`\u00d4ng th\u1ee3 s\u1eeda \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u1ed3`,`cast`:[{`name`:`Mr Bach`,`vn`:`\u00f4ng B\u00e1ch, th\u1ee3 s\u1eeda \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u1ed3 \u1edf s\u1ed1 1, r\u1ea5t \u0111\u00fang gi\u1edd v\u00e0 hi\u1ec1n`},{`name`:`Lam`,`vn`:`L\u00e2m, 14 tu\u1ed5i, ch\u00e1u n\u1ed9i \u00f4ng B\u00e1ch, hay mu\u1ed9n nh\u01b0ng kh\u00e9o tay`}],`ch`:[{`floor`:`A1`,`part`:2,`parts`:3,`title`:`A Week of Midnights`,`titleVN`:`M\u1ed9t tu\u1ea7n nh\u1eefng n\u1eeda \u0111\u00eam`,`words`:`monday|tuesday|wednesday|thursday|friday|saturday|sunday|week|weekend|afternoon|evening|night|midnight|tonight|tomorrow|yesterday|next|later|until|once|twice|again|during`,`paras`:[{`en`:`[[On]] [[Monday]], Lam [[and]] [[his]] [[grandfather]] [[wait]] [[next to]] [[the]] [[old]] [[clock]]. [[The]] [[evening]] [[is|be]] [[long]]. [[At]] [[midnight]], [[the]] [[clock]] [[stops|stop]]. Mr Bach [[opens|open]] [[it]] [[and]] [[looks|look]] [[inside]]. [[Everything]] [[looks|look]] [[OK]].`,`vn`:`Th\u1ee9 Hai, L\u00e2m v\u00e0 \u00f4ng ng\u1ed3i ch\u1edd b\u00ean chi\u1ebfc \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u1ed3 c\u1ed5. Bu\u1ed5i t\u1ed1i d\u00e0i d\u1eb1ng d\u1eb7c. \u0110\u00fang n\u1eeda \u0111\u00eam, \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u1ed3 d\u1eebng. \u00d4ng B\u00e1ch m\u1edf n\u00f3 ra xem b\u00ean trong. M\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 tr\u00f4ng v\u1eabn \u1ed5n.`},{`en`:`[[On]] [[Tuesday]], [[he]] [[cleans|clean]] [[every]] [[small]] [[part]]. [[During]] [[the]] [[day]], [[the]] [[clock]] [[works|work]] [[well]]. [[It]] [[works|work]] [[all]] [[afternoon]] [[and]] [[all]] [[evening]]. [[But]] [[at]] [[midnight]], [[it]] [[stops|stop]] [[again]]. [[On]] [[Wednesday]], [[it]] [[is|be]] [[the]] [[same]]. [[On]] [[Thursday]] [[night]], [[it]] [[stops|stop]] [[twice]]: [[once]] [[at]] [[midnight]], [[and]] [[again]] [[at]] [[one]]!`,`vn`:`Th\u1ee9 Ba, \u00f4ng lau ch\u00f9i t\u1eebng chi ti\u1ebft nh\u1ecf. Ban ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u1ed3 ch\u1ea1y t\u1ed1t. N\u00f